### Musician session (Jorge, profile 1, bands 1 and 3) - JWT for the calls below
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/session/wallet
Content-Type: application/json

{ "walletPubkey": "YmTYQJifjP2DawdxDUYuNCZJ5to9ge5nNGaWGW2ozJU" }

> {% client.global.set("musician", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Account outside the band (jwt.gate)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jwt.gate@eh8s.local",
  "password": "eh8s-dev-pass1"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken); %}

### HARMONY without Bearer must be 401
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/bands/3/match-suggestions

### Rank candidates for band 3 (Jorge on guitar): instrument gap 40 + level 30 + country 15 + genre 15.
### withAi adds a Claude rationale for the top 5 when ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is set (aiUsed false otherwise).
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/bands/3/match-suggestions
Authorization: Bearer {{musician}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "withAi": true }

### Stored ranking, best first
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/bands/3/match-suggestions
Authorization: Bearer {{musician}}

### Not a band member is 403
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/bands/3/match-suggestions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unknown band is 404
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/bands/999/match-suggestions
Authorization: Bearer {{musician}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}
